            "review_title": "Review at Ryuko",
            "review_text": "Evelynne G\nMelbourne, Australia807 contributions\n0\nSmall Japanese Restaraunt serving good food\nNov 2017 • Business\nOur business associate booked for the six of us for dinner. We had B B Q Japanese style. As we did not do the ordering we ate\nwhat was ordered. The steak was from Japan and USA. The Japanese steak was by far the best. We wrapped each piece in a lettuce leaf to eat it.We sat Japanese style so if you have trouble getting up and down you would need to ask to sit at a table with chairs\nRead more\nWritten November 17, 2017",
