            "review_text": "mac d\n1 contribution\n0\nOhh dear ! No tampura here and no taste\nOct 2017 • Couples\nI Love Japanese food , but this place puts the cuisine to shame. We had beef croquettes, pork katsu and a fish pancake and all of it tasted old and awful. The staff did not care and we're not friendly or polite \nThere are many nice places to get your fill of tasty japanese, this place is not one of them.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 25, 2017",
