            "review_text": "Rhonda R\nMelbourne, Australia46 contributions\n0\nBeautiful Japanese food\nJun 2016 • Couples\nWe stayed in Ho Chi Minh for 4 nights and ate here 3 times. Food was amazing, so fresh. Try the superb egg salad. We had sirloin barbecue beef twice and a stock pot one other time, the mushrooms were the best I have ever eaten. I usually don't like mushrooms. \n\nStaff have limited English, but are attentive and very efficient. Prices are also very reasonable.\n\nWould highly recommend.\nRead more\nWritten June 3, 2016",
