            "review_text": "edt0\nSingapore, Singapore92 contributions\n0\nGood Japanese restaurant beside Norfolk Hotel\nMay 2016 • Business\nDecided to visit this restaurant for dinner since it is just beside the Norfolk Hotel where I stayed.\n\nFood is good here. We ordered the Gokujyou Shiokawa Tan, Gyubara, Jyou Harami, Tontoro etc.. My Japanese colleagues also agreed with my comments.\n\nFood is inexpensive, and the service is good. Nice place to chill out after work if you decide not to go far for food.\nRead more\nWritten May 12, 2016",
